{"3346220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of Diamond", "steam_appid": 3346220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dimensional distortion, Jennifer, a young mage, awakens in a cursed floating castle. To escape and find her lost love, she must explore treacherous rooms, solve puzzles, and reveal the secrets hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle hordes of enemies, overcome deadly hazards, and unlock new abilities that allow you to venture deeper into the castle. Each new area puts Jennifer's strength and determination to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of Diamond is an action-exploration metroidvania set in a world of magic and mystery. Can Jennifer break the curse and escape, or will the castle consume her?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dimensional distortion, Jennifer, a young mage, awakens in a cursed floating castle. To escape and find her lost love, she must explore treacherous rooms, solve puzzles, and reveal the secrets hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle hordes of enemies, overcome deadly hazards, and unlock new abilities that allow you to venture deeper into the castle. Each new area puts Jennifer's strength and determination to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of Diamond is an action-exploration metroidvania set in a world of magic and mystery. Can Jennifer break the curse and escape, or will the castle consume her?</p>", "short_description": "After a mysterious flash, Jennifer, a young mage, awakens inside a cursed floating castle. Explore its halls, battle creatures, and master new abilities to find a way out and reunite with her lost love.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346220/45ce5c08cd2c7a53cd0f056475b4fd34c19a3c81/header.jpg?t=1788285049", "capsule_im